  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_2
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: "<size=20>- Before game starts, choose your play style by selecting a random
      multiplier set.\n- Chosen multiplier set can be changed at anytime during the
      game.\n- Wild substitutes for all symbols except Scatter.\n- Wild appears in
      reels 2, 3, and 4. \n- Wins with Wild randomly award Multipliers from the chosen
      set. "
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: '<size=20>- 3 or more Scatters from leftmost to right on adjacent reels
      triggers Free Games.

      - A second screen will appear displaying 6 Free Game options.

      - Each option enables a different number of Free Games and Featured Multipliers. '
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>243 WAYS</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Base Bet: 50</color></size>'
